``` 1. Pipeline check: is Windows Security data arriving at all? ```
index=* | stats count by sourcetype

``` 2. Attack Timeline panel: failed logons vs. lockouts over time ```
index=* sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode IN (4625, 4740)
| eval Event_Type=case(EventCode==4625,"Failed Login", EventCode==4740,"Account Lockout")
| timechart span=30m count by Event_Type

``` 3. Top Targets panel: which accounts are being hit ```
index=* sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625
| stats count by user
| sort - count

``` 4. Failed logons by host ```
index=* sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625
| chart count by host

``` 5. ALERT: account lockout (real-time, trigger per result) ```
index=* sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4740
| table _time host user
